  "ingredients": [
    "2 (12 ounce) packages milk chocolate chips",
    "2 (12 ounce) packages white chocolate chips",
    "2 teaspoons peppermint extract",
    "8 peppermint candy canes, crushed, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients and line a 12x18 inch jelly roll pan with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Hac7eLGhAfmt48cQ3cbrTZeECMw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-155827-milk-chocolate-peppermint-bark-VAT-step-01-2-3f4cd160735d4806a25973a368ea4ff8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155827/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt the milk chocolate in a microwave-safe glass or ceramic bowl in 30-second intervals, stirring after each melting, for 1 to 5 minutes (depending on your microwave). Do not overheat or chocolate will scorch. Stir in the peppermint extract. Spread the chocolate evenly in the prepared pan; chill until set, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/85vAnm5Ym5zq6ORYW5wkyuIg3bo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-155827-milk-chocolate-peppermint-bark-VAT-step-02-3-2b40d2156a1947e3bb76f1b4dd766c19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155827/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt the white chocolate in a microwave-safe glass or ceramic bowl in 30-second intervals, stirring after each melting, for 1 to 5 minutes. Stir in 1/4 cup of the crushed candy canes. Spread the white chocolate mixture evenly over the milk chocolate. Sprinkle the remaining candy cane pieces evenly over the white chocolate layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3QoeFulDXWrym_3fnJOEy3Eelcw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-155827-milk-chocolate-peppermint-bark-VAT-step-03-1-6bc636c7183341c980a95bd2b357effa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155827/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill until set, about 1 hour. Break into small pieces to serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
